{"id":68556,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68556"},"modified":"2026-10-13T22:49:41","modified_gmt":"2026-10-13T21:49:41","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-tarouca","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-tarouca\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Tarouca 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Tarouca 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Tarouca 2026<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, assinalando a estreia hist\u00f3rica de uma corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre no concelho de <strong>Tarouca<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>). Com partida e chegada instaladas no <strong>Centro C\u00edvico da Cidade de Tarouca<\/strong>, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> para a prova principal e \u00e0s <strong>18:05<\/strong> para a caminhada, culminando num lanche conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 19:30 e cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio \u00e0s 19:45.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A prova competitiva de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (cerca de 9,8 km com <strong>200 m D+<\/strong> acumulados) \u00e9 disputada num circuito urbano de duas voltas de aproximadamente 5 km pelas art\u00e9rias de <strong>Tarouca<\/strong> \u2014 terra hist\u00f3rica do Vale do Varosa, c\u00e9lebre pelo Mosteiro de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o de Tarouca e pela Ponte Fortificada da Ucanha \u2014, enquanto a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> percorre uma volta completa ao tra\u00e7ado. Cada volta combina uma descida longa e r\u00e1pida nos primeiros 1,4 km, um setor interm\u00e9dio ondulado at\u00e9 ao km 3,1 e uma subida exigente entre o km 3,1 e o km 4,4 com rampas que atingem os 18% de inclina\u00e7\u00e3o. Prepara os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">corridas de 10 km em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Tarouca<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vale Varosa<\/strong>, esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o inaugural est\u00e1 limitada a 500 participantes e distingue-se pelos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios atribu\u00eddos ao Top 5 da Classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Geral Masculina e Feminina (300 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 150 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 75 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba, 40 \u20ac ao 4\u00ba e 20 \u20ac ao 5\u00ba classificado), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us para os tr\u00eas primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Centro C\u00edvico da Cidade de Tarouca, Viseu<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><stro